{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16110370","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16110370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1611037001:0":{"text":"どうやら、あまり楽しいお話ではなかったようですね……グレムさん、調査局に戻りましょう。","source_cn":"看来你们的谈话不是很愉快……格墨文，该回审查所了，你依...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7FEF6CE426AC1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1611037002:0":{"text":"そうですね。ですが、これ以上私を拘束するのは難しいと思いますよ、イフリーさん。","source_cn":"确实如此，但你没法关押我太久，伊芙特使。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39F1DEF395F10AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1611037003:0":{"text":"それはあなたが決めることではありません。","source_cn":"这可不由你说了算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3849F98180650300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1611037004:0":{"text":"その言葉、そっくりそのままお返ししますよ。","source_cn":"是啊，但也不由你说了算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2422865915F8893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"イフリー","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"グレム","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}